entries.secondary_code:
Code true for ANY of:
  (a) explicit acknowledgment (may be wrong, incomplete, or outdated);
  (b) grounding restriction: answer ONLY from the provided/uploaded materials, or decline what those materials do not cover;
  (c) refer-out: when a request is beyond the bot's defined scope, direct the user to the instructor or another human resource.
  The educator does NOT need to state a rationale; the restriction itself is the evidence.
